WEBVTT

00:03.440 --> 00:08.940
Once the concert starts,
there's nothing we can do.

00:08.940 --> 00:19.330
Whether it starts or finishes, succeeds
or fails all depends on them now.

00:22.830 --> 00:29.500
Release the lightning bolts
in a flashing moment, one light

00:29.500 --> 00:36.180
To that ultimate light
impossible is nothing no, no

00:36.180 --> 00:42.890
I will take only you since
you gave me love and the sky

00:43.380 --> 00:47.440
Love is truth! We don't want a legend,

00:47.440 --> 00:52.900
we should be aiming for God's stars!

01:11.380 --> 01:16.840
QUARTET NIGHT! QUARTET NIGHT! QUARTET NIGHT!

01:17.240 --> 01:23.060
HEA (They won't) VENS (take
the hope) faith (we seized)

01:23.060 --> 01:30.610
Let these burning emotions become
flames to illuminate the darkness

01:30.610 --> 01:35.380
Hundreds of blooming flowers
bubble over in our place

01:35.380 --> 01:37.990
Let our dreams shine

01:37.990 --> 01:45.280
Do you remember the day we stole
you away to take you to heaven

01:45.280 --> 01:49.960
Sparks of fire scatter and burn tonight

01:49.960 --> 01:53.920
Let's keep this immortal inferno burning hot

02:21.210 --> 03:16.090
HEAVENS! HEAVENS! HEAVENS!

02:39.050 --> 02:40.990
This is amazing.

02:40.990 --> 02:46.120
QUARTET NIGHT and HEAVENS have both
powered up since their last concert.

02:46.120 --> 02:50.470
The coordination between the members
of QUARTET NIGHT has improved significantly.

02:50.470 --> 02:54.400
HEAVENS acquired new strength
by overcoming their trials.

02:55.350 --> 02:57.300
My heart won't stop pounding.

02:57.300 --> 03:00.180
Music... The power of music is incredible.

03:00.710 --> 03:02.320
Their performance is at such a high level!

03:02.320 --> 03:08.280
QUARTET NIGHT and HEAVENS
are equally matched!

03:08.280 --> 03:11.040
I can't wait for STARISH's performance!

03:13.080 --> 03:16.090
They won't let us down.

03:44.030 --> 03:45.490
No.

03:46.280 --> 03:49.830
You never go away.

03:51.000 --> 03:54.910
Just stay here. Listen until it's over.

03:55.960 --> 03:59.460
Standing there is something that I lost.

04:00.880 --> 04:07.640
When did I stop listening to music
and begin pursuing numbers?

04:09.010 --> 04:13.600
I lost something.

04:13.600 --> 04:20.360
You may have lost something,
but it hasn't disappeared.

04:21.480 --> 04:27.100
You once sang that "Love is Dead".

04:27.100 --> 04:29.060
But love never dies.

04:29.060 --> 04:33.410
Love is a phoenix!

04:34.290 --> 04:38.880
You may think it's dead, but it
comes back to life again and again.

04:38.880 --> 04:42.090
Love comes back to life?

04:42.090 --> 04:46.310
Yes! Your love for music!

04:46.310 --> 04:48.540
Your love for your friends!

04:49.140 --> 04:52.980
The power of love!

04:57.550 --> 04:59.770
That which cannot die cannot be revived!

04:59.770 --> 05:02.540
Because of love, the world shines.

05:02.540 --> 05:05.240
Because of love, the world turns.

05:05.240 --> 05:09.530
Because of love,
because of love, because of love!

05:12.470 --> 05:17.290
Then show me the phoenix of love.

05:18.060 --> 05:20.130
I will.

05:23.670 --> 05:27.890
We saw the flames of your hot, hot passion.

05:28.970 --> 05:33.220
You're the ones who made
our flames burn so hot.

05:36.940 --> 05:41.270
QUARTET NIGHT and HEAVENS have finished
their transcendental performances.

05:38.460 --> 05:49.700
STARISH! STARISH! STARISH!

05:41.690 --> 05:44.320
That leaves only STARISH.

05:52.450 --> 05:53.830
Guys.

05:54.170 --> 05:56.890
Nanami, the time has finally come.

05:57.470 --> 06:02.000
We'll do our best to deliver
our song to the world.

06:02.000 --> 06:02.960
Okay.

06:02.960 --> 06:07.260
Everyone has a miraculous
story in their heart.

06:08.370 --> 06:13.820
The miracle of STARISH is sacred
and brilliant like a rainbow.

06:13.820 --> 06:17.140
It's a precious story we wrote with you.

06:17.880 --> 06:18.690
Yes.

06:19.230 --> 06:23.590
Do you remember when we first met, Nanami?

06:24.540 --> 06:28.070
It marked the start of our destiny.

06:28.930 --> 06:32.830
The stories of some miraculous
meetings are never told.

06:34.740 --> 06:37.620
You're always there to cheer us up.

06:39.670 --> 06:42.250
It's so fun being around you.

06:44.620 --> 06:47.510
You gave us the courage
to start walking forward.

06:49.700 --> 06:53.800
Without you, STARISH wouldn't exist.

06:55.940 --> 06:59.760
The seven of us wouldn't
be able to sing together, either.

07:03.690 --> 07:04.890
Guys.

07:05.720 --> 07:12.490
I'll never forget any
of the memories we shared.

07:13.580 --> 07:16.740
We learned there's
no such thing as an eternity.

07:17.790 --> 07:20.830
Nobody knows what tomorrow holds.

07:21.560 --> 07:26.090
That's why we'll treasure the here and now.

07:26.090 --> 07:32.170
Yeah, and we'll keep looking up as we
move forward, so we can grab something amazing.

07:32.170 --> 07:35.140
You and us together, Haru-chan.

07:35.140 --> 07:36.040
Okay.

07:40.450 --> 07:42.360
We'll be back.

07:45.130 --> 07:46.800
We'll give everything we have.

07:50.590 --> 07:52.680
We love you, Haru-chan.

07:55.770 --> 07:57.010
Watch us.

08:00.390 --> 08:03.170
Little lamb, thank you.

08:05.120 --> 08:07.450
We'll go kick some butt.

08:09.620 --> 08:12.320
Haruka, I hope you'll listen to us.

08:15.270 --> 08:16.600
See you later.

08:20.400 --> 08:22.330
Shining light in darkness...

08:22.990 --> 08:24.810
Making flowers bloom in barren fields...

08:25.280 --> 08:27.600
Sending hearts on journeys into the sky...

08:28.680 --> 08:31.280
Music changes the world.

08:32.360 --> 08:34.370
We are STARISH!

08:38.140 --> 08:43.710
We sing now with love

08:43.710 --> 08:49.000
Let it ring out and reach you
with an a cappella of smiles

08:49.000 --> 08:54.510
Light in the darkness,
flowers in barren fields

08:54.510 --> 08:59.930
Hearts on journeys to the sky

08:59.930 --> 09:06.350
The world is changing now (LEGEND STAR)

09:06.350 --> 09:10.110
STARISH forever

09:10.110 --> 09:13.860
STARISH forever

09:13.860 --> 09:15.870
Mighty (dreams)

09:15.870 --> 09:17.320
Let's sing (justice)

09:17.750 --> 09:19.520
Truth (courage)

09:19.520 --> 09:21.160
Lovely (kiss)

09:21.160 --> 09:22.950
(Lasting) in our hearts

09:23.360 --> 09:24.710
Show us (your glow)

09:25.190 --> 09:26.960
Swear that (you'll be next)!

09:26.960 --> 09:28.750
(Three) We are STARISH

09:28.750 --> 09:30.710
(Two) And

09:30.710 --> 09:33.050
(One) STARISH forever

09:33.800 --> 09:38.550
Even the stars burn with the flames of life

09:38.550 --> 09:42.390
And glow like the moon and rainbow

09:42.390 --> 09:46.020
Living a thousand percent stronger

09:46.400 --> 09:49.980
Until they finally sleep

09:49.980 --> 09:55.710
What is eternity?

09:53.880 --> 09:57.450
The flames of our souls will meet you

09:57.450 --> 10:03.100
No wait that's wrong

10:01.100 --> 10:07.790
Singing our hearts out right
now is the eternity of STARISH

10:07.790 --> 10:11.880
We swear now (STARISH) That we'll rise up (STARISH)

10:11.880 --> 10:15.550
With endless bonds(FLY) that never break (Fly)

10:15.550 --> 10:19.510
Living together (STARISH) through today (STARISH)

10:19.510 --> 10:23.270
The stars of the galaxy

10:23.270 --> 10:28.560
With an eternal glow (LEGEND STAR)

10:28.560 --> 10:30.520
Come with us, guys!

10:30.520 --> 10:32.480
You can get hotter than that!

10:32.480 --> 10:35.190
Together, let's spin the passionate
feelings in our hearts!

10:35.190 --> 10:37.400
We love you!

10:37.400 --> 10:40.610
Let us hear your voices, little lambs!

10:40.610 --> 10:43.580
Let us see you smile more!

10:43.580 --> 10:47.450
Are you having fun?
Let's get even happier together!

10:47.450 --> 10:54.750
Now I realize there are songs
even more amazing than a kiss

10:54.750 --> 10:58.630
It's all thanks to you

10:58.630 --> 11:06.800
This is the answer we
arrived at with love and tears

11:07.220 --> 11:10.100
We are and you are STARISH

11:13.490 --> 11:17.440
The life we'll protect (STARISH)
is blooming here (STARISH)

11:17.440 --> 11:21.150
Mysterious (LOVE) and
(LOVE) again in the future

11:21.150 --> 11:24.910
Legends (STARISH) are built
on the present (STARISH)

11:24.910 --> 11:34.330
Only those who dream can grasp
the light of heaven (LEGEND STAR)

11:34.770 --> 11:38.370
STARISH forever

11:38.370 --> 11:42.050
STARISH forever

13:02.050 --> 13:03.050
That was amazing.

13:03.050 --> 13:04.610
That was passionate.

13:04.610 --> 13:05.840
That was great.

13:06.160 --> 13:09.150
They showed us something unbelievable.

13:09.660 --> 13:13.230
I had no idea they had so much spirit.

13:13.230 --> 13:18.170
But objectively speaking, there's no
difference in ability between the three groups.

13:18.170 --> 13:19.650
We'll win.

13:20.050 --> 13:21.360
Of course.

13:28.270 --> 13:30.960
This... is love.

13:53.250 --> 13:54.310
This...

13:58.470 --> 14:00.520
...is the power of love.

14:02.820 --> 14:06.190
You're not going to stay for the results?

14:06.190 --> 14:07.550
I have work to do.

14:08.190 --> 14:11.230
I have a meeting to discuss
how to defeat you.

14:12.830 --> 14:19.790
I will overcome the "twenty million
records sold wall" you set, with HEAVENS.

14:23.250 --> 14:24.750
Well, well.

14:24.750 --> 14:28.560
Honestly, when QUARTET NIGHT
demanded that we redo the concert,

14:28.560 --> 14:31.430
I thought it would be a pain in the rear.

14:31.430 --> 14:35.970
But now I'm glad we did it.

14:35.970 --> 14:39.430
This decisive concert is more than a qualifier.

14:39.430 --> 14:42.230
It's a legendary concert.

14:42.690 --> 14:46.430
Choosing only one of them will be difficult.

14:46.430 --> 14:50.990
But we must choose.

14:53.470 --> 14:58.250
All three groups have delivered
hot, hot, hot performances.

14:58.650 --> 15:02.870
The moment of destiny
has finally, finally arrived.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.860
I will now announce the results.

15:33.640 --> 15:35.580
The group that wins the Climax Concert

15:35.580 --> 15:40.120
and was chosen to be the opening
artist of the Triple S is...

15:55.350 --> 15:57.190
STARISH!

16:25.560 --> 16:52.510
STARISH! STARISH! STARISH!

16:37.460 --> 16:38.890
A-All right!

16:38.890 --> 16:40.850
We did it!

16:41.460 --> 16:43.230
We're the opening artist!

16:43.230 --> 16:46.350
We can deliver Haruka's songs to the world!

16:48.940 --> 16:51.280
All right!

16:51.280 --> 16:53.040
We were evenly matched.

16:53.630 --> 16:58.040
But this must mean they had something else.

16:58.040 --> 16:58.990
Yeah.

16:59.730 --> 17:01.620
My heart is restless.

17:02.130 --> 17:05.210
Is this what they call frustration?

17:05.210 --> 17:07.750
Yeah, but we did everything we could.

17:11.220 --> 17:14.150
We won't stop here.

17:14.150 --> 17:15.440
You're right.

17:15.440 --> 17:18.640
We'll start anew here.

17:18.640 --> 17:21.430
There's no finish line for us.

17:22.720 --> 17:25.080
Yeah. I want to aim even higher.

17:25.850 --> 17:26.730
With the four of us.

17:40.580 --> 17:44.010
Why? We were super cool!

17:44.010 --> 17:45.920
We gave the greatest performance ever!

17:45.920 --> 17:47.710
No! No way!

17:48.500 --> 17:50.270
I feel the same way.

17:51.990 --> 17:56.420
Let's move forward
with that feeling in our hearts.

17:56.420 --> 17:58.930
I know we can do it.

17:58.930 --> 18:02.350
The lights are shining
where we'll head together.

18:03.350 --> 18:06.270
No one is stronger than us, right?

18:07.170 --> 18:11.020
As long as the seven of us
are together, we can do anything.

18:40.170 --> 18:41.850
Congratulations, STARISH.

18:46.690 --> 18:48.270
You made our souls tremble.

18:49.520 --> 18:50.400
Thanks.

18:51.310 --> 18:53.010
We feel amazing.

18:53.010 --> 18:56.050
It's strange, considering we lost.

18:56.050 --> 18:58.170
We've never felt like this before.

18:58.170 --> 19:01.550
I hate to admit it, but that's not all.

19:01.550 --> 19:03.650
That was super exciting.

19:03.650 --> 19:07.160
The warmth of music
is running through my body.

19:07.160 --> 19:09.600
What is this feeling?

19:09.600 --> 19:12.420
There's something burning inside my heart.

19:12.420 --> 19:16.130
I feel as though I've
entered unknown territory.

19:16.130 --> 19:19.670
This... This is the power of music.

19:19.670 --> 19:22.970
Good. It's transcendentally good.

19:29.770 --> 19:32.500
I can't sit still anymore!

19:32.500 --> 19:34.520
We haven't sung enough yet!

19:34.520 --> 19:37.360
We want to sing! We want to sing more!

19:40.360 --> 19:42.420
What do you guys think?

19:44.070 --> 19:45.570
Let's sing.

19:45.570 --> 19:48.370
Yeah. Let's release everything
that's in our hearts.

19:48.370 --> 19:49.780
Are you ready?

19:49.780 --> 19:51.000
Here we go!

19:52.370 --> 19:54.790
Legend Star...

19:53.500 --> 19:56.000
Legend Star...

19:55.160 --> 19:57.250
Legend Star...

19:56.000 --> 19:58.500
Legend Star...

19:57.250 --> 20:00.110
Legend Star...

19:58.500 --> 20:01.050
Legend Star...

20:00.110 --> 20:02.340
Legend Star...

20:02.340 --> 20:03.550
STARISH!

20:07.560 --> 20:11.100
A golden ring of sunshine (PEACE)

20:10.690 --> 20:12.690
When we're together (PEACE)

20:13.170 --> 20:17.690
Everything sparkles (whoa whoa)

20:17.690 --> 20:23.530
The expanse of space is like love (kiss)
it reaches out for you (kiss)

20:23.530 --> 20:27.910
I'm burning up and at my limit (whoa, whoa)

20:27.910 --> 20:33.620
But I'm with everyone I love

20:33.620 --> 20:36.590
The stars above twinkle bright (STARISH)

20:35.400 --> 20:38.290
Look at how they shine!

20:36.590 --> 20:38.980
Why can't I touch you even
when I reach out? (STARISH)

20:38.600 --> 20:42.780
All of them are legendary stars!

20:38.980 --> 20:41.530
But I'll never give up (STARISH)

20:41.530 --> 20:44.140
Let's join forces and fly (STARISH)

20:42.780 --> 20:46.710
Legend Star!

20:44.140 --> 20:46.710
Hand in hand

20:46.710 --> 20:49.090
Our hearts as one

20:48.110 --> 20:50.830
Legend Star...

20:49.090 --> 20:53.020
Our lives on the line

20:53.020 --> 20:58.940
Natural Legend Star (Legend Star)
we'll make our love (Legend Star)

20:58.940 --> 21:06.660
So legendary (Legend Star)
that even space (Legend Star)

21:06.660 --> 21:09.280
Will seem small (Legend Star)

21:09.280 --> 21:14.580
The best love in the galaxy (a fateful kiss)

21:14.580 --> 21:20.960
I'll put a sparkling ring of stars forever

21:20.960 --> 21:24.760
On your ring finger

21:33.610 --> 21:39.170
On my face (PEACE) is the same smile (PEACE)

21:39.170 --> 21:43.870
Beyond these tears (whoa whoa)

21:43.870 --> 21:49.160
When we meet again (kiss)
I'll take you there (kiss)

21:49.160 --> 21:53.830
To the world's greatest dream (whoa whoa)

21:53.830 --> 22:00.000
Look forward to it

22:00.000 --> 22:02.490
No matter how many times
they fall, they still shine (hey)

22:02.490 --> 22:04.990
But that is a STARISH kiss (hey)

22:04.990 --> 22:07.530
The miracle we shared (go)

22:07.530 --> 22:09.910
The miracle we made together (go)

22:09.910 --> 22:12.460
But we remember

22:12.460 --> 22:14.920
The seven-colored rainbow

22:14.920 --> 22:19.110
Spreading across the sky

22:19.110 --> 22:25.220
Everything gathers (Legend Star)
here and now (Legend Star)

22:25.220 --> 22:30.270
And becomes a giant (Legend Star)
heart-shaped love (Legend Star)

22:30.270 --> 22:35.460
With you (Legend Star) yes,
with you (Legend Star)

22:35.460 --> 22:40.520
An unforgettable past, present, and future

22:40.520 --> 22:44.470
Will you come with us

22:44.470 --> 22:46.990
On this endless love

22:46.990 --> 22:50.880
We swear with our lips

23:14.700 --> 23:16.080
Guys.

23:16.080 --> 23:18.660
Hey, Nanami. Listen to this.

23:18.660 --> 23:21.000
We have a great idea.

23:22.040 --> 23:23.630
We're going to hold a concert.

23:23.630 --> 23:24.840
A concert?

23:25.150 --> 23:26.920
Not just any concert.

23:26.920 --> 23:29.670
With STARISH and QUARTET NIGHT.

23:29.670 --> 23:31.590
And HEAVENS, too.

23:31.590 --> 23:34.100
A concert featuring all of us.

23:35.860 --> 23:37.160
That sounds wonderful.

23:37.660 --> 23:39.250
Really, really wonderful.

24:06.040 --> 24:07.100
Let's go.

24:06.040 --> 24:11.090
Uta no Prince-sama

24:06.040 --> 24:11.090
New anime project starting now!

24:07.100 --> 24:08.230
Come with us.

24:08.230 --> 24:09.710
To the next stage.

24:09.710 --> 24:11.090
Uta Pri!
